    "question": "Alex gets paid $500 a week and 10% of his weekly income is deducted as tax. He also pays his weekly water bill for $55 and gives away another 10% of his weekly income as a tithe. How much money does Alex have left?",
    "gold": "345",
    "answer": "His income tax is 10% of 500 which is 500*10% = $<<500*10*.01=50>>50.\nHis tithe costs 10% of $500 which is 500*10% = $<<500*10*.01=50>>50.\nThe total expenses are 50 + 55 + 50 = $155\nHe is then left with $500 - $ 155= $<<500-155=345>>345.\n#### 345"
  },
